{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1463787-statistician-it-x-magick","id":1463787,"title":"Statistician (It-X) Magick","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-13T21:09:58-07:00","id":1463787,"title":"Statistician (It-X) Magick","content":"To begin, I want to differentiate Techno-Magickal Divination from Population Targeted Magick. The first merely informs the caster and does not change anything. The second affects whole populations and is the focus of this post. <br /> <br /> I am considering a potential use where a Technomancer tries to increase the likelihood of crime occurring in a Chantry by targeting sleepers in the population from which the Traditions are recruiting Acolytes. &quot;Rogue Mage stole tass/talisman&quot; is a standard intrigue plot used for Chantries and has the potential to move the organization toward a Winter Phase. So, the effect would merge the potential for sleepers in a geographic area to start committing property crime and their probability of manifesting qualities attractive to mystic recruiters. I'm thinking Correspondence 3, Entropy 3, Mind 4, Time 4, Prime 1 - In a specified area, raise probabilities in an interrelated group of developing attitudes and beliefs that steer them toward criminality and Chantry membership. <br /> <br /> Pacification is another idea that can easily be coincidental. Social media has actually been used as a tool of pacification, collecting data on users and then introducing addictive features that distract them from real concerns. <br /> <br /> Another approach I will call &quot;Delayed Emergence&quot; would be artificially inhibiting a natural trend in the short term to build up the potential for it to manifest with greater intensity in the future. I have a group of steroid users Statistically Linked as a group so that the probability of one manifesting deadly aggression builds up over time, with an intended future release that impacts Tradition Mages. It plays on concepts of Karma and the liabilities of political rulership.<br /> <br /> Combing Pacification with Delayed Emergence, Statistician Procedures could attempt to produce a Wellspring at a time and place they stand to benefit from - harvesting Quintessence. Suppress the tendency for the population to express a shared concern through censorship and then quietly disseminate information about faults in the mechanism of censorship. This doesn't need to be for the selfish or maniacal faction driven ends a storyteller concocts for plot conflict.<br /> <br /> Suppose Statisticians review past Technocracy propaganda campaigns aimed at the Sons of Ether, where open source engineering in the public interest was portrayed as kooky anti-capitalist nonsense. They determine that the world would benefit from a spontaneous movement toward a Green Reality 2.0. They call forth the long delayed potential for this and cause it to occur. <br /> <br /> What kind of Population Targeted Statistician Magick effects would you use as storyteller or player?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}